    <bpmn:serviceTask isForCompensation="false" startQuantity="1" name="Update Remaining Vacation" id="_4b72053b-8ebb-4ae6-99c6-7c93cf1c1d1b" triso:readOnly="false">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <ino:profilename value="ROOT PROFILE" />
        <ino:stereotypename value="task" />
        <ino:typename value="MID.Innovator.API.icw2bp.BPTaskNode" />
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="update" />
        <kp:field name="requestMethod" stringValue="POST" />
        <kp:field expression="https://crm.knowprocess.com/miwg/contacts/${employeeBadgeNumber}/customFields" name="requestUrl" stringValue="https://crm.knowprocess.com/miwg/contacts//customFields" />
        <kp:field name="requestHeaders" stringValue="Content-Type:application/json" />
        <kp:field expression="{&quot;customFields&quot;:{&quot;vacationDays&quot;:${vacationDays}}}" name="requestBody" />
        <kp:field name="resultVariablePrefix" stringValue="upVacation1" />
        <kp:field name="saveRequestVariables" stringValue="false" />
        <kp:field name="saveResponseParameters" stringValue="true" />
        <adonis:instance>
          <adonis:attribute lang-independent="v0" name="IDENTIFICATION_OF_CHANGES" notebook="1" novalue="0" sourcelang="en" type="ENUM">
            <adonis:value>No change</adonis:value>
            <adonis:metavalue />
          </adonis:attribute>
          <adonis:attribute name="A_EXECUTION_TIME" notebook="1" novalue="0" sourcelang="en" type="UTC">
